{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117454","id":3401643543,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KwPYX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117454","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117454.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117454.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117454","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117454/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117454/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117454/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a61e6ffade5b678956f209e7bf99582aeba7d052","number":117454,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add UTF-8 encoding to svg file open in `platform_builders.py`","user":{"login":"DSOE1024","id":90103853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTAzODUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90103853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024","html_url":"https://github.com/DSOE1024","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DSOE1024/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes the build failure on Windows by explicitly specifying UTF-8 encoding when reading SVG files in platform/platform_builders.py, preventing the UnicodeDecodeError caused by the system default GBK encoding.\r\n\r\nWhen building Godot on Windows, the build process fails with a UnicodeDecodeError during the generation of SVG icon headers for platform exporters. This happens because platform/platform_builders.py reads SVG files without explicitly specifying UTF-8 encoding, causing Python to fall back to the system default encoding — which is GBK on Chinese Windows installations.\r\n\r\nWindows systems configured for Chinese locales use GBK as the system default encoding, while SVG files are universally stored in UTF-8 and often contain multi-byte special characters that cannot be decoded correctly by GBK. This encoding mismatch results in an immediate decoding failure and halts the build.\r\n\r\nThe specific error message is as follows:\r\n```\r\nUnicodeDecodeError : 'gbk' codec can't decode byte 0xaa in position 174: illegal multibyte sequence \r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"C:\\Users\\...\\SCons\\Action.py\", line 1434, in execute \r\n    result = self.execfunction(target=target, source=rsources, env=env) \r\n  File \"...\\platform\\platform_builders.py\", line 14, in export_icon_builder \r\n    svg = file.read() \r\nUnicodeDecodeError: 'gbk' codec can't decode byte 0xaa in position 174: illegal multibyte sequence\r\n```\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labe